WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.500
In nineteen oh one, Dadabhai

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.380
Naoroji gave a book a title that

3
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.060
stung. Poverty and Un British

4
