20
00:00:39.307 --> 00:00:40.927
Half a billion pounds.

21
00:00:40.927 --> 00:00:43.147
From eighteen thirty five to

22
00:00:43.147 --> 00:00:44.847
eighteen seventy two, he

23
00:00:44.847 --> 00:00:46.927
estimated, about five hundred

24
00:00:46.927 --> 00:00:49.287
million pounds was kept back by

25
00:00:49.287 --> 00:00:50.117
England.

26
00:00:50.731 --> 00:00:52.991
The candle at both ends.

27
00:00:52.991 --> 00:00:55.731
Wealth left every year, so no

28
00:00:55.731 --> 00:00:57.091
